*.db-shm

# A captured attestation is a REAL device artifact: Apple's leaf certificate carries
# <TEAMID>.<bundle id> in plaintext, so committing it publishes the developer account behind the
# app. This repo is public and commits nothing identifying. The test skips when it is absent;
# see internal/appattest/README.md to capture your own.
internal/appattest/testdata/attestation.bin
internal/appattest/testdata/attestation.keyid
internal/appattest/testdata/attestation.clientdata
internal/appattest/testdata/attestation.appid
